{"id":"ee59458b6acb7c90","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic.md","title":"树序数算术","display":"df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic — 树序数算术","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic","aliases":["72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic"],"display":"df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic — 树序数算术","chapter":"III","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III §2.11; Ex.2.15(1); print155–157; PDF167–169","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_status":"checked","source_proof_status":"local-well-founded-recursion-argument","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic — 树序数算术"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III §2.11; Ex.2.15(1); print155–157; PDF167–169"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-well-founded-recursion-argument"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" href=\"?note=2e4aa3df9477aa6f\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal\">72-df-tree-ordinal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\">\\((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\cdot}:\\omega\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\overline{\\cdot}:\\omega\\to\\Omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\omega\\in\\Omega\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\omega\\in\\Omega\\)</span> 由下式引入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}:\\Omega^2\\to\\Omega\">\\(\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}:\\Omega^2\\to\\Omega\\)</span> 依次按右参数的严格子树关系递归定义，前一个运算可用于后一个运算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n),\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\omega\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n),\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\omega\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta),\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta),\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\otimes\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)\\oplus\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\otimes\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\alpha\\otimes\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)\\oplus\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\otimes\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\overline1,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf S\\beta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\otimes\\alpha,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta_i))_{i\\in\\omega}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\overline1,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf S\\beta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\otimes\\alpha,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta_i))_{i\\in\\omega}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 §2.11 的加法、乘法、幂及 Example 2.15(1) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega=\\sup_n(1+n)\">\\(\\omega=\\sup_n(1+n)\\)</span>；印刷 pp.155–157 / PDF pp.167–169，已逐页核对。使用不同于 von Neumann 序数算术的运算符，保留基本序列和完整语法树。这里不另取商，也不把不同基本序列认成相同对象。</p>\n<p>良定义性：根标签唯一给出零、后继或极限分支；每个递归调用的右参数是严格子树。先构造加法，再用它构造乘法，最后构造幂；各步输出均由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L\\)</span> 闭包落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 中。严格子树关系良基，故每一步有唯一的全函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> 的自然数递归及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\omega\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\omega\\)</span> 的可数极限构造也唯一。这里没有声称任意两个结构化输入的乘法或幂仍然结构化；原书 Theorem 2.13 对这两项另有非零/大于一的前驱条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"2e4aa3df9477aa6f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega$；$n\\in\\omega$；$(\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L,\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}\\in\\Omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline{\\cdot}:\\omega\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\omega\\in\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}:\\Omega^2\\to\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\overline{n+1}\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\overline n),\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\omega\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\overline{n+1})_{n\\in\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\oplus\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq\\mathsf S(\\alpha\\oplus\\beta),\\qquad\\alpha\\oplus\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\oplus\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha\\otimes\\mathbf0\\coloneqq\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf S\\beta\\coloneqq(\\alpha\\otimes\\beta)\\oplus\\alpha,\\qquad\\alpha\\otimes\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega})\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\alpha\\otimes\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathbf0)\\coloneqq\\overline1,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf S\\beta)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta)\\otimes\\alpha,\\qquad\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\mathsf L((\\beta_i)_{i\\in\\omega}))\\coloneqq\\mathsf L((\\operatorname{Pow}(\\alpha,\\beta_i))_{i\\in\\omega}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega=\\sup_n(1+n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0,\\mathsf S,\\mathsf L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline n","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2922,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic|df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic — 树序数算术]]"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic|df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic — 树序数算术]]"},{"id":"246d4beb5dedc741","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$H$ 见 [[72-df-hardy-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]。$\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\Omega$，$n\\in\\omega$。函数复合按 $(f\\circ g)(n)=f(g(n))$ 解释。"},{"id":"f6e6568ea7b179d6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\overline k$ 是 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]] 中递归定义的有限树序数；$k,n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"c9e7ac8b29af6dc7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G$ 见 [[72-df-slow-growing-hierarchy]]；$\\oplus,\\otimes,\\operatorname{Pow}$ 见 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]；$\\alpha[n]$ 及有限链性质见 [[72-lem-tree-predecessor-chain]]。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tree-ordinal-arithmetic]]"}],"outgoing":["2e4aa3df9477aa6f"]}